                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "en",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "6c5e40d0-5837-442f-8d5d-ae98b687e02d",
                        "entry_id": "e92c5776-10ed-3020-99f5-d5dc6cb5409e",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "shipyards"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f7339ae0-45e5-38ec-b064-e07a19c30212",
                        "entry_id": "e92c5776-10ed-3020-99f5-d5dc6cb5409e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A place where ships are built and repaired."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d0634d57-1937-48bb-95b5-d595af480ec4",
                                "sense_id": "f7339ae0-45e5-38ec-b064-e07a19c30212",
                                "text": "To my mind, it appears obvious in the context of total shipwork, the private shipyards are doing very well indeed. It is true that with the dwindling size of the Navy, there will be less repair work."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9bb8ea8d-a3e6-412e-9a6b-0f10e6bef7a2",
                                "sense_id": "f7339ae0-45e5-38ec-b064-e07a19c30212",
                                "text": "On the Chickahominy, the Hazelwood brothers' fish house at Hicks Island and the Menzel brothers' fish house near the old shipyard thrived by serving local and distant markets. As late as 1977, a Publick Observer article boasted, \"If you are served turtle soup in Atlanta or catfish in Ft. Wayne, Ind., chances are good that the main ingredients came from the waters of the James or the Chickahominy.\""
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4fac27bd-e690-4105-863f-d94c53139ece",
                        "source_entry_id": "e92c5776-10ed-3020-99f5-d5dc6cb5409e",
                        "source_sense_id": "f7339ae0-45e5-38ec-b064-e07a19c30212",
                        "source_sense_description": "place to build and repair ships",
                        "target_lang_word": "loděnice",
                        "target_lang_code": "cs",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7b842ddf-02d8-46f7-99cb-47812c3fa0d3",
                        "source_entry_id": "e92c5776-10ed-3020-99f5-d5dc6cb5409e",
                        "source_sense_id": "f7339ae0-45e5-38ec-b064-e07a19c30212",
                        "source_sense_description": "place to build and repair ships",
                        "target_lang_word": "scheepswerf",
                        "target_lang_code": "nl",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "scheepswerf",
                                "target_lang_code": "nl",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0f964689-ee70-3abf-bb42-b3ddb8e942db",
                                        "entry_id": "53ea99b0-89d9-3907-8f3d-f7f565d89f18",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "een aan het water gelegen werkgebied waar schepen gebouwd worden"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c8efbb4b-94e9-4278-a6e8-2fb7a538b284",
                                                "sense_id": "0f964689-ee70-3abf-bb42-b3ddb8e942db",
                                                "text": "\"Roemenen werken op Nederlandse scheepswerf voor 1 euro per uur\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "965c63be-3731-4252-9b9d-4ca3eb1a4367",
                                                "sense_id": "0f964689-ee70-3abf-bb42-b3ddb8e942db",
                                                "text": "Uit eigen beweging vertelde hij mij dat hij afkomstig is van het eiland Kreta, dat de Europese beschaving daar is ontstaan, dat dat geen toeval is, dat hij eigenaar is van een rederij en scheepswerf in Heraklion, dat dat hard werken is maar dat hij zich graag inspant voor de mensheid en dat hij de economische crisis goed was doorgekomen omdat hij anders dan de meesten van zijn concurrenten al jaren geleden had begrepen dat de toekomst buiten Europa lag."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c05924fd-5c51-4794-beb7-6f0414d18bba",
                        "source_entry_id": "e92c5776-10ed-3020-99f5-d5dc6cb5409e",
                        "source_sense_id": "f7339ae0-45e5-38ec-b064-e07a19c30212",
                        "source_sense_description": "place to build and repair ships",
                        "target_lang_word": "chantier naval",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "chantier naval",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a3ebe5d8-616e-36dc-955f-b177c8090372",
                                        "entry_id": "c55cf176-3e8c-363d-a549-41af5288cf0e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Lieu de construction des bateaux."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7054f699-4289-4b18-b69b-2fe2fcafe764",
                                                "sense_id": "a3ebe5d8-616e-36dc-955f-b177c8090372",
                                                "text": "Eh bien, d'après Drake, dit-il, Nelson avait commencé par entrer aux chantiers navals comme traceur, travaillant sur des épures et des projets de construction, et apprenant comme un fou tout ce qu'il pouvait des techniciens russes qui étaient arrivés en foule depuis la victoire de Mao."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "36629ee1-c2a8-421c-b108-cb21cb9bc68f",
                        "source_entry_id": "e92c5776-10ed-3020-99f5-d5dc6cb5409e",
                        "source_sense_id": "f7339ae0-45e5-38ec-b064-e07a19c30212",
                        "source_sense_description": "place to build and repair ships",
                        "target_lang_word": "Werft",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Werft",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9ec81b69-a727-3437-9880-118874eb410a",
                                        "entry_id": "f6940768-c6c1-320d-b390-0342317dd31c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Industrieanlage zum Bauen und Reparieren von Schiffen oder Flugzeugen"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "517ac32e-7952-47af-a9dd-34e7612e4d6a",
                                                "sense_id": "9ec81b69-a727-3437-9880-118874eb410a",
                                                "text": "„In aller Frühe ließ er uns heraustrommeln, lief mit uns im Laufschritt zum Dampfer, und wir fuhren zur Werft, um dort die einzelnen Gegenstände für unsere Ausrüstung zu requirieren.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ebe9ac3a-5bcd-4dd8-ab08-07ffde27d1d7",
                                                "sense_id": "9ec81b69-a727-3437-9880-118874eb410a",
                                                "text": "„Am Ende der städtischen Werften begannen die Becken, wo die Schiffe ausgestattet oder gebaut wurden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9aac5e0a-1615-4041-9109-a1fdc9c4db48",
                                                "sense_id": "9ec81b69-a727-3437-9880-118874eb410a",
                                                "text": "„In den Küstenstädten Wismar, Rostock und Stralsund sind moderne und leistungsfähige Werften entstanden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9a10482d-cae7-4d10-9af1-13a03da8ff9a",
                                                "sense_id": "9ec81b69-a727-3437-9880-118874eb410a",
                                                "text": "„Die Werft in Turku ist eine der größten Europas.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
